CI warns that these actions target Node.js 20 (deprecated; forced onto Node 24 for now): actions/checkout@v4, actions/setup-python@v5, actions/upload-artifact@v4, softprops/action-gh-release@v2 in .github/workflows/ci.yml. Bump to versions that run on Node 24 natively. Non-blocking: the v0.1.0 run was fully green. Ref: https://github.blog/changelog/2025-09-19-deprecation-of-node-20-on-github-actions-runners/
